QUICK REVISION TABLE
================================================================================

+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| PROBLEM                  | REMEMBER                                   |
+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| Fetch in render          | Render should stay pure                    |
| Effect every render      | Valid only when actually intended          |
| Unstable object          | Render-created object has new identity     |
| Effect state loop        | Effect changes dependency repeatedly       |
| Race condition           | Older request may finish later             |
| No HTTP check            | Inspect response.ok                        |
| No catch                 | Promise failure isn't handled              |
| Stuck loading            | Handle failure path                        |
| No cancellation          | Obsolete work may continue                 |
+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------+


